  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>DV_Monster_Tusktroll</defName>
    <label>ogre</label>
    <description>The larger, meaner and smarter cousin of the common northern troll. Ogres, unlike their cousins, are solitary creatures, preferring to live alone in ruins to brood.n/n/Ogres are only found outside of their hideouts during mating season, where they're exceptionally rowdy.</description>
